+/*
+ * Math functions in the channels of rgb(), hsl() and hwb() (VitaSurf).
+ * CSS Values lets calc(), min(), max() and clamp() stand wherever a
+ * number, percentage or angle may, and Bulma 1's sheet has 102 colours
